ducing the number of microorganisms in the environment by chemical agents or by physical means which do not reduce the safety or appropriateness of food by \"disinfectants\",\n\n\"Food hygiene\" shall mean the conditions and practices necessary to ensure the safety and appropriateness of food at all times of the meal,"
