hin the authoritative area of Eheliyagoda Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n2. This By-law is known as the By-law of mobile trading of Eheliyagoda Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\n3.(1) No person shall sell food or any other goods in the area of authority of the Eheliyagoda Pradeshiya Sabha unless"
