    "chunk_size_bytes": 1967,
    "chunk_text": "\"The licensee\" shall mean an individual or person who obtains a license under this by-law,\n\n\"Pesticides\" shall mean pesticides approved by the Registrar of Pesticides of Sri Lanka,\n\n\"Cleaning\" shall mean removes any accumulated food waste or other harmful external contaminants and soil,\n\nsafety and proper quality of food,\n\n\"Pollution\" shall mean Incorporation or combustion of combustible materials into a food or food environment,\n\nReducing the amount of organisms in the environment by chemical agents or by physical shall mean,\n\n\"Disinfectant\" shall mean reducing the amount of organisms in the environment by chemical agents or by\n\nphysical,\n\n\"Food security\" shall mean ensure that the food is safe and appropriate at all times in the food chain,\n\n\"Hazard\" shall mean certain biological, chemical, or physiological agents or conditions associated with foods that\n\nmay have an adverse health impact.\n\n\"Food handler\" shall mean someone who works directly on food, food equipment and tools, or on the surface\n\nwhere food touches,\n\n\"Food safety\" shall mean the responsibility of the consumer not to cause any harm when the food is processed,\n\nprocessed, distributed, transported or eaten,\n\n\"Drinking water\" shall mean water that is not sufficiently contaminated to cause disease or physical harm to the\n\nbody and complies with national standards for bacterial and chemical conditions,\n\n\"Food\" shall mean any goods imported, manufactured, sold or represented for use as human food, and any item\n\ncommonly taken or used in the composition or preparation of food.\n\n\u201cCommodities and goods\" shall mean everything that can be sold legally in Sri Lanka with the exception of the\n\nfood chain.\n\n\"Mobile trade\" shall mean any type of food, goods or materials sold or displayed for public consumption by the\n\nuse of a container, box, or other kind of aid, or in any vehicle, bicycle or cart or hand carriage. It means a trade that is being carried away or stopped somewhere."
